/*
Problem: Duplicate Emails
LeetCode #182

Write a solution to report all the duplicate emails.

An email is considered duplicate if it appears more than once
in the Person table.

Approach:
GROUP BY + HAVING

1. GROUP BY email groups identical email addresses together.
2. COUNT(email) counts how many times each email appears.
3. HAVING filters groups with more than one occurrence.
*/

SELECT email
FROM Person
GROUP BY email
HAVING COUNT(email) > 1;
